=2 Walkthrough
* As a White Mage, examine the **Door: Prince Regent's Rm** in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} at (H-8) to start this quest.
** You must be able to access {z:Chateau d'Oraguille}.
*** Players from {p:San d'Oria} must be rank 2, but players from other nations must be on {M:Bastok|Bastok Mission 2-3|The Emissary} / {M:Windurst|Windurst Mission 2-3|The Three Kingdoms} **Mission 2-3** or later.
* Go to {z:Castle Oztroja} or {z:Castle Zvahl Keep} and kill {m:Yagudo Abbots|Yagudo Abbot} until a {@i:Yag. Holy Water|1097} {i:Yagudo Holy Water|Yag. Holy Water|1097} drops.
* Yagudo Abbots spawn behind the brass door at (G-8) on map 3.
** The combination to these levers can be found behind the secret door at (I-10) on the same map.
** Yagudo Abbots located at (G-9) & (G-10) on map 2 in Castle Zvahl Keep can also drop Yagudo Holy Water. Although fewer of them spawn in this zone, they are 1-7 levels lower than Yagudo Abbots in Castle Oztroja.
* Find a pair of {@i:Moccasins|12995} {i:Moccasins|Moccasins|12995}
